    "endMs": 37270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "门铃响起，识别结果触发专属振动，屏幕显示门铃事件。",
    "startMs": 38650,
    "endMs": 43813,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
