    "startMs": 43930,
    "endMs": 49270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "开启交谈模式，系统优先提醒附近的人声。",
    "startMs": 50650,
    "endMs": 54311,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "一次轻柔长振，提醒你抬头看看。",
