    "endMs": 61270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "户外模式关注车铃与鸣笛，识别后发送短促振动。",
    "startMs": 62650,
    "endMs": 66903,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "停一停，看看周围，再由自己判断下一步。",
    "startMs": 67008,
    "endMs": 70358,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "这是环境提示，不替代道路观察。",
    "startMs": 70463,
    "endMs": 73270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
