    "startMs": 74650,
    "endMs": 77393,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "门铃是两组双击，人声是一段长振，交通提示是三次短振。",
    "startMs": 77494,
    "endMs": 81965,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
